{"id":"wb-3-158","name":"金刚座舍利宝塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"金刚座舍利宝塔","text":"金刚座舍利宝塔，位于内蒙古自治区呼和浩特市玉泉区，是一座砖制金刚宝座式塔，因塔顶有5座小塔，故也俗称为“五塔”。该塔始建于清朝雍正年间，由塔座、塔身和五塔三个部分组成，通高16.5米。该塔下建有地宫，但具体情况不详。1988年，金刚座舍利宝塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%88%9A%E5%BA%A7%E8%88%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%AE%9D%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86787031,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86787031","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/71a63e27fe7c8c03691b9ad1.jpg","title":"Five_Pagoda_Temple,_Huhhot,_Inner_Mongolia.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Five_Pagoda_Temple,_Huhhot,_Inner_Mongolia.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/Five_Pagoda_Temple%2C_Huhhot%2C_Inner_Mongolia.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"me (w:User:pfctdayelise)","license":"CC BY-SA 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5","caption":"​　呼和浩特五塔寺或zh:慈灯寺塔在内蒙古，中国","width":320,"height":427}}